---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
import { releaseTagUrl } from '../releaseDownloads.mjs';
import { candidateServiceNotice, releaseState } from '../releaseState';
---
<BaseLayout title="amail — 让 Agent 真正拥有邮件工作流" description="amail 是面向 AI Agent 的 CLI 邮件软件。用一个可组合的命令行管理地址、检索邮件，并通过 ZIP 交换消息。" current="home" components>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">The agent-native mail client · {releaseState === 'published' ? 'v0.3.1' : 'v0.3.1 candidate'}</div>
        <h1>邮件工作流，<br /><em>交给 Agent。</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">你决定授权边界。Agent 在独立 Profile 下，通过 <strong>amail</strong> 注册测试邮箱、检索和整理邮件。共享守护进程协调读写占用；人类 Profile 的操作默认逐次在浏览器确认。</p>
        <p class="hero-privacy">语义检索默认关闭：由 user 批准启用后，后台才会经 OpenRouter / Voyage 4 为全部保留邮件及新邮件建立索引；关闭保留旧向量。<a href="/manual/#隐私与边界">了解处理方式 ↗</a></p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="moe-button button button-primary" href="/manual/">{releaseState === 'published' ? '开始使用' : '了解候选设计'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="moe-button button button-secondary" data-variant="secondary" href="/manual/#安装与首次登录">{releaseState === 'published' ? '选择安装包' : '预览安装指南'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">为 <code>mail.moesegfault.dev</code> 而生 · Linux / macOS / Windows<br />{releaseState === 'published' ? <>v0.3.1 已发布；<a href={releaseTagUrl}>下载安装包与 Agent Skill ↗</a></> : 'v0.3.1 尚未发布；安装包与 Agent Skill 将在验收后开放。'}</p>
        {releaseState === 'candidate' && <p class="hero-note">{candidateServiceNotice}</p>}
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="amail 工作流示意：检索邮件、交给 Agent 处理并以 ZIP 发送">
        <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="work-card card-inbox">
          <span class="card-kicker">01 · INBOX</span>
          <span class="card-title">需要处理的邮件</span>
          <span class="card-meta">匹配条件 → 最小元数据</span>
          <span class="mail-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-line flow-a" aria-hidden="true">↘</div>
        <div class="work-card card-agent">
          <span class="agent-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
          <span class="card-kicker">02 · AGENT</span>
          <span class="card-title">理解，决定，行动</span>
          <span class="card-meta">文本 / HTML · 可组合命令</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-line flow-b" aria-hidden="true">↙</div>
        <div class="work-card card-package">
          <span class="card-kicker">03 · PACKAGE</span>
          <span class="card-title">message.zip</span>
          <span class="card-meta">正文 + 资源 + 元数据</span>
          <span class="zip-seal" aria-hidden="true">ZIP ↗</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="promise-band" aria-label="产品原则"><div class="wrap promise-grid">
    <p><strong>一个身份</strong><span>使用 moeSegFault 账号登录</span></p>
    <p><strong>按任务分配 Profile</strong><span>共享读，独占写，不抢占</span></p>
    <p><strong>不必打开收件箱</strong><span>检索优先，而不是页面优先</span></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section why-section"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A different interface</span><h2>不是把网页邮箱<br />塞进终端。</h2><p>amail 从 Agent 的真实工作方式出发：先缩小范围，再获取内容；先准备完整的消息包，再发送。每一步都可被组合、审查和自动化。</p></div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">01 /</span><div class="feature-icon">⌕</div><h3>检索，而非翻页</h3><p>组合时间、标题、元数据和正文条件；需要时再用正则、大小写选项和语义检索。已读状态也是筛选条件，而不是一次“打开”动作。</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">02 /</span><div class="feature-icon">▣</div><h3>ZIP 是交接点</h3><p>接收时把邮件交给 Agent 可处理的文件；发送时把正文、资源与元数据装进 ZIP。amail 负责解析、校验和邮件编译，Agent 不必直接改动底层邮件。</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">03 /</span><div class="feature-icon">◈</div><h3>默认简洁，按需展开</h3><p>机器输出紧凑、方便管道捕获；需要给人看时再使用 <code>--human</code>。常用操作短，复杂选项留在消息包里，不让每条命令都像配置文件。</p></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section flow-section"><div class="wrap flow-grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Your role / Agent's role</span><h2>你确定边界。<br />它完成工作。</h2><p>登录必须由你明确完成。为 Agent 分配 Profile 与邮箱读写占用；临时测试地址最长六小时。user 默认逐操作确认，Agent 不应替你点击授权或开启 YOLO。</p><a class="text-link" href="/manual/">阅读完整使用流程 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <ol class="steps"><li><span>1</span><div><strong>登录</strong><p>在 <code>login.moesegfault.dev</code> 授权 amail。</p></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><strong>建立地址</strong><p>在 <code>mail.moesegfault.dev</code> 下注册专属邮箱。</p></div></li><li><span>3</span><div><strong>交给 Agent</strong><p>检索、取用、整理，并用 ZIP 准备回复。</p></div></li></ol>
  </div></section>

  <section class="closing"><div class="wrap closing-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">{releaseState === 'published' ? 'Ready when you are' : 'Candidate under review'}</span><h2>让邮件回到工作流里。</h2><p>从 v0.3.1 开始，把「查找、理解、回复」接成一条线。</p></div><a class="moe-button button button-primary" href="/manual/">打开用户手册 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
